# comments.iron expected-scopes reference.
Token                    | Scope
-------------------------|--------------------------------
// plain line comment    | comment.line.double-slash.iron
-- transitional comment  | comment.line.double-dash.iron
/// doc comment          | comment.block.documentation.iron
//json:id directive      | meta.directive.iron (key: keyword.other.directive.iron)

Iron has one comment form, `//`; `--` and `///` are accepted while code
migrates (manual 1.2). There is no block comment. Comment markers inside a
string stay string text.
